WEBVTT

00:04:26.626 --> 00:04:30.824
pa na ndare nga bota jone.

00:04:30.824 --> 00:04:35.170
Sot, e nisem duk biseduar mbi kufijte,

00:04:35.170 --> 00:04:37.850
por nqse ne i heqim keto kufij,

00:04:37.850 --> 00:04:41.738
i vetmi kufi qe mbetet eshte imagjinata jone.

00:04:41.738 --> 00:04:42.986
Faleminderit.

00:04:42.986 --> 00:04:48.071
(Duartrokitje)